    },
    {
      "item": "Scanner Role",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The scanner role is used by the scanner instances that are launched in the orchestrator subscription to perform data scanning. The role is assigned at the AI Security resource group level and has the following permissions:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "table": [
        [
          "Permission",
          "Scope",
          "Type",
          "Purpose"
        ],
        [
          "*/read",
          "AI Security resource group",
          "Actions",
          "To allow read permissions to read the metadata of Azure resources"
        ],
        [
          "Microsoft.KeyVault/vaults/secrets/getSecret/action",
          "AI Security resource group",
          "DataActions",
          "To get the value of a secret"
        ],
        [
          "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/blobServices/*/read",
          "AI Security resource group",
          "DataActions",
          "To read blobs from containers"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Custom Network Configuration Role",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To configure a custom network in your organization, the orchestrator requires the following roles and permissions at the subscription level, to establish a connection between the custom network components, the scanner instance, and SQL database.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "These permissions are conditional and only required if Custom Network is selected.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "table": [
        [
          "Permission",
          "Scope",
          "Type",
          "Purpose"
        ],
        [
          "Microsoft.Network/networkSecurityGroups/join/action",
          "Orchestrator Subscription",
          "Actions",
          "To join the Network Security Group of the Custom Network mode"
        ],
        [
          "Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks/subnets/join/action",
          "Orchestrator Subscription",
          "Actions",
          "To join the subnet of the Custom Network"
        ],
        [
          "Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks/subnets/joinViaServiceEndpoint/action",
          "Orchestrator Subscription",
          "Actions",
          "To join the SQL database to a subnet of the Custom Network"
        ]
      ]
    },
